.PP
Remove all owned Parts\&. Detaches mounts, authored bindings, and physics bodies\&. Retained \fBPart\fP references remain usable with their local state, but no longer update with the \fBSprite\fP\&. If any \fBPart\fP belongs to the active physical rig, throws before removing anything; call \fBdisableAnimationPhysics()\fP first\&.

