.SS "\fBPart\fP createPart (string name)"

.PP
Create an independently animated \fBPart\fP\&. The \fBSprite\fP owns and advances the \fBPart\fP\&. Names must be nonempty and unique within this \fBSprite\fP; invalid names throw\&. Parts do not require Spriter artwork or physics\&.

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIname\fP Nonempty name unique within the owning \fBSprite\fP\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
The new \fBPart\fP\&. Its ID remains stable while owned by this \fBSprite\fP; \fBtransferPart()\fP assigns a new destination-local ID\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBExample\fP
.RS 4

.PP
.nf
const hand = sprite\&.createPart('hand');
hand\&.moveTo(new pdg\&.Point(12, 0), 0\&.25, pdg\&.easeInOutQuad);

.fi
.PP
.RE
