.SS "object getAnimationPose ()"

.PP
Copy the fully evaluated pose\&. Refreshes the current pose, including persistent overrides and controllers, and returns an owned snapshot\&. Editing or retaining it does not affect the \fBSprite\fP\&. A getter may reevaluate modifiers with deltaSeconds equal to zero\&.

.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
An independent snapshot described below\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
Call \fBenableAnimationPose()\fP successfully before using this method\&. Inside a modifier, use view\&.copy() instead of querying the \fBSprite\fP\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBExample\fP
.RS 4

.PP
.nf
const pose = sprite\&.getAnimationPose();
const hand = pose\&.bones\&.find(bone => bone\&.name === 'hand');
console\&.log(hand\&.rotation);

.fi
.PP
.RE
.PP

.PP
\fBPose snapshot fields\fP
.RS 4
Field  Contents  \fRrigRevision\fP  Rig identity as a decimal string; compare before reusing cached bone or binding IDs\&.  \fRbones\fP  Array in bone-ID order\&. Each entry has \fRname\fP, \fRparent\fP (index or null), and the six parent-local transform fields below\&.  \fRbindings\fP  Array in binding-ID order\&. Each entry has \fRname\fP, \fRparent\fP (bone index or null), \fRkind\fP (image 0, point 1, box 2), and the six parent-local transform fields\&.  \fRvariables\fP  Array of \fR{object, name, type, value}\fP records\&. An empty object name selects entity metadata\&. Types are float 0, integer 1, and string 2\&.  \fRtags\fP  Array of \fR{object, tags}\fP records, where tags is an array of strings\&. An empty object name selects entity tags\&.  
.RE
.PP
Transform field  Units / meaning  \fRx\fP, \fRy\fP  Position in parent-local distance units\&.  \fRrotation\fP  Clockwise angle in radians\&.  \fRscaleX\fP, \fRscaleY\fP  Dimensionless axis scales; may include reflection\&.  \fRalpha\fP  Opacity from 0 to 1\&.  

.PP
Declared variable defaults are used when a clip has no matching track\&. Missing tag tracks produce empty sets\&. During a blend, string variables and tags switch at the halfway point\&. Undeclared variables are absent\&.

.PP

.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
\fBsampleAnimationPose()\fP, \fBgetAnimationBoneTransform()\fP 
.RE
.PP

