\fIspace\fP Integer coordinate-space constant: \fR\fBpdg\&.animationSpace_Local\fP\fP (parent frame), \fR\fBpdg\&.animationSpace_Rig\fP\fP, or \fR\fBpdg\&.animationSpace_World\fP\fP (owning layer)\&. Local uses the root bone's parent frame\&.
