.SS "transitionToAnimation (string clip, number timeSeconds, number durationSeconds)"

.PP
Blend the current pose into a selected clip\&. Starts the destination clip at the requested time while blending from the current base pose\&. Interrupting a transition captures its current blended pose\&. A zero duration switches immediately\&. Completion sends action_AnimationBlendComplete when the \fBSprite\fP belongs to a layer\&.

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIclip\fP Name of a compatible clip in the current Spriter entity\&. 
.br
\fItimeSeconds\fP Finite sample time in seconds\&. Looping clips wrap, including negative times; nonlooping clips clamp to their endpoints\&. 
.br
\fIdurationSeconds\fP Finite nonnegative blend duration in seconds; zero switches immediately\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
No value\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
Call \fBenableAnimationPose()\fP successfully before using this method\&. Call outside animation callbacks\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBExample\fP
.RS 4

.PP
.nf
sprite\&.transitionToAnimation('reference', 0, 0\&.3);

.fi
.PP
.RE
.PP
